1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:09,041
Associated Press reports that Chinese humanoid robots beat human records at the World Humanoid Robot Games in Beijing.

2
00:00:08,991 --> 00:00:18,285
One robot completed a 100-meter sprint in 9.39 seconds, faster than Usain Bolt's world record.

3
00:00:18,285 --> 00:00:22,741
Organizers say more than 2,000 robots are taking part.

4
00:00:22,741 --> 00:00:30,373
Experts note that most humanoids are still used mainly for demonstrations and research, not everyday work.

